{
  "markdown": "**FORM SSA-1099 – SOCIAL SECURITY BENEFIT STATEMENT**\n\n\n2026\n- PART OF YOUR SOCIAL SECURITY BENEFITS SHOWN IN BOX 5 MAY BE TAXABLE INCOME.\n- SEE THE REVERSE FOR MORE INFORMATION.\n\n\n<table>\n<tr><td colspan=\"2\">Box 1. Name<br>CAROL WILLIAMS</td><td colspan=\"2\">Box 2. Beneficiary's Social Security Number<br>417-00-XXXX</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Box 3. Benefits Paid in 2026<br>$25,182</td><td colspan=\"2\">Box 4. Benefits Repaid to SSA in 2026</td><td>Box 5. Net Benefits for 2026 (Box 3 minus Box 4)<br>$25,182</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<table>\n<tr><td rowspan=\"4\">DESCRIPTION OF AMOUNT IN BOX 3<br>Paid by check or direct deposit: $20,229<br><br>Medicare Part B premiums deducted from<br>your benefits: $2,435<br><br>Total additions:<br><br>Benefits for 2026: $25,182</td><td>DESCRIPTION OF AMOUNT IN BOX 4</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Box 6. Voluntary Federal Income Tax Withholding<br>$2,518</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Box 7. Address<br>1234 CHARITY AVENUE<br>YOUR CITY, YOUR STATE, ZIP</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Box 8. Claim Number (Use this number if you need to contact SSA.)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nForm **SSA-1099-SM** (6/2020)\n\n\nDO NOT RETURN THIS FORM TO SSA OR IRS\n\n\n<!-- doc_id=parse-01m423wk5jajbvfnphgrwppey2 -->",
